Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 06:04:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD clean-review completion confirmation so users close
 accepted patches

The controller records a pending yes/no confirmation after a resolved review, so a positive reply marks the feature done locally and other chat replies return to the normal agent-send path. Terminal highlighting follows that controller-owned pending state instead of inferring intent from transcript text.
